      "side": 1,
      "message": "It seems to me the main problem here is caching these \"default\" values and restoring them after each transaction. This also includes the scheduling policy and the priority not just uclamp. I don\u0027t see why a thread couldn\u0027t instead go back to whatever settings it had before the transaction was initiated. Doesn\u0027t this make more sense to drop `proc-\u003edefault_priority`?",
      "revId": "df2be36eba6d8724decc58735039d33c6784f3f8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
