      "writtenOn": "2023-04-20T01:43:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes the uclamp values stored in binder_priority are assigned to a task later on via `sched_setattr_nocheck()` as part of the priority inheritance. See aosp/2222625.\n\nThe task\u0027s previous values are supposed to be restored after the transaction is over. However, the `default_priority` will override everything at the end. I\u0027m trying to remove this behavior but it\u0027s a little complicated.",
      "parentUuid": "2696abca_5e5d4c82",
      "revId": "df2be36eba6d8724decc58735039d33c6784f3f8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
